DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261127
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270104
SUMMARY:Leiria Natal rides: Comboio\, Roda & Carrossel
LOCATION:Jardim Luís de Camões\, Leiria
DESCRIPTION:Opening night 7pm–midnight. After that: Mon–Thu 2–8pm\, F
 ri 2pm–midnight\, Sat 11am–midnight\, Sun 11am–8pm. The Christmas tr
 ain is for ages 2–16\, and the Ferris wheel (age 3+) gives a view over a
 ll the lights. €2 per ride.\n\nhttps://www.teatrojlsilva.pt/evento/combo
 io-eletrico-2026
URL:https://www.teatrojlsilva.pt/evento/comboio-eletrico-2026
