DESCRIPTION:Theme: Pinóquio and the world of marionettes. Kids can make th
 eir own puppet\, write to Pai Natal and go skating. Fri–Sun & holidays 1
 0am–9pm\, Mon–Thu 10am–6pm. Closed 25 Dec & 1 Jan. Tickets €12 adu
 lt\, €8 child (3–11)\, family from €36. Book a time slot online.\n\n
 https://obidosvilanatal.pt/en/hours-and-prices
URL:https://obidosvilanatal.pt/en/hours-and-prices
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
